5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To avoid the tragedy of a beautiful drawing that decays in five years, I shall examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to ensure we can actually build this. I'll look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm worried about the money later on, so I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am interested in the operational reality. I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we must understand how the site is actually used. I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
